## Summary

The exact Cerium hexahydrate promotion, sugar-beet Arabinan alias, Barley grain alias and beta-Estradiol create are supported within their stated limits. Cerium and Arabinan retain broad-only external mappings; Barley gains no ontology assertion; Estradiol dose/source/export holds persist. This batch is source-record review, not whole-source identity, stable adoption, application or release approval.

