    preserves beta stereochemistry rather than identifying generic estradiol or17alpha.
    The new owner omits the conflicting quantity and does not assert a growth-factor
    role. SYNONYM_MATCH supports an exact external mapping candidate after genuine
    native review, independently of source identity/export acceptance. The record
    marks its new agent mapping evidence LLM_SUGGESTION and its curation history llm_assisted.
